  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside Divine Bean Palace, after using yama so Qing Chou cannot detect him, Fang Yuan stands on Qing Chou’s back and activates the immortal killer move great thief ghost hand. A huge black eerie hand enters Qing Chou’s body and returns clenched, carrying what Fang Yuan then stores in his immortal aperture. Qing Chou roars that someone stole its Soul Beast Token, and Fang Di Chang links the theft to Fang Yuan’s earlier demand for great thief Immortal Gu. Chen Yi thinks of Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable when he sees a rank seven steal a rank eight Immortal Gu from an immortal aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        1528
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_divine_bean_palace",
        "char_qing_chou",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "gu_soul_beast_token",
        "char_fang_di_chang",
        "gu_great_thief",
        "char_chen_yi",
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan conceptualizes great thief ghost hand with rank nine killer move ghostly concealment as the core and rank seven great thief Immortal Gu and others as the supplement, which is why it can steal a rank eight Immortal Gu such as Soul Beast Token.",
      "chapters": [
        1529
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "composition-and-limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The move cannot last long and has no sealing properties, so he must refine the stolen Gu himself while the ghost hand weakens under Soul Beast Token’s struggle. He later notes that even with great thief ghost hand and ghostly concealment he only replicates a trace of Thieving Heaven’s capabilities, and recalls the legend of Thieving Heaven’s move steal heart that steals the will inside Immortal Gu to refine them instantly.",
      "chapters": [
        1529
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "composition-and-limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After gaining results in comprehending the Steal Life true inheritance, he can specify the intended target for great thief ghost hand to steal. When he knows the target well and where their Immortal Gu are, he can steal Immortal Gu every time, as when he empties Yang Ku’s Immortal Gu into a wisdom refinement formation.",
      "chapters": [
        1790
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "target-selection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_steal_life_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan lists great thief ghost hand among his compound killer moves formed from soul path and theft path.",
      "chapters": [
        2065
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "compound-path-list",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
